{
    "lesson": 20,
    "title": [
        "Let's go camping!",
        "我们去露营吧！"
    ],
    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Monday 30 June",
                "6月30日，星期一"
            ],
            [
                "Elyse: Good evening!",
                "伊莉斯：晚上好！"
            ],
            [
                "How're you guys doing tonight?",
                "你们今晚过得怎么样？"
            ],
            [
                "Anna: I'm very good.",
                "安娜：我非常好。"
            ],
            [
                "I just finished my homework.",
                "我刚做完作业。"
            ],
            [
                "Bradley: Me too.",
                "布拉德利：我也是。"
            ],
            [
                "How about you?",
                "你呢？"
            ],
            [
                "Elyse: I'm checking my weekly schedule...I'm afraid that I can't go on Friday around midday as we planned before.",
                "伊莉斯：我正在查看我的周计划表……恐怕我不能像我们之前计划的那样周五中午左右去了。"
            ],
            [
                "I forgot that day I have to see a doctor in the afternoon.",
                "我忘了那天下午我得去看医生。"
            ],
            [
                "Can we leave on Saturday morning?",
                "我们能周六早上出发吗？"
            ],
            [
                "Bradley: Is it possible that you'll visit the doctor before that day?",
                "布拉德利：你有可能在那天之前去看医生吗？"
            ],
            [
                "The weather forecast shows it will be cloudy and foggy on Saturday.",
                "天气预报显示周六会多云有雾。"
            ],
            [
                "We won't be able to see the beautiful full moon and the stars if we arrive one day later.",
                "如果我们晚一天到，就看不到美丽的满月和星星了。"
            ],
            [
                "Elyse: Maybe visiting a doctor can be next week.",
                "伊莉斯：也许看医生可以安排在下周。"
            ],
            [
                "I'll confirm it by Wednesday!",
                "我会在周三之前确认！"
            ],
            [
                "Tuesday 1 July",
                "7月1日，星期二"
            ],
            [
                "Elyse: I have changed the time to visit the doctor so we can leave at noon on Friday!",
                "伊莉斯：我已经改了看医生的时间，这样我们周五中午就可以出发了！"
            ],
            [
                "I will drop by the grocery store on Thursday after class.",
                "我周四下课后会顺便去杂货店。"
            ],
            [
                "Anna: Cool!",
                "安娜：太棒了！"
            ],
            [
                "I'll go with you.",
                "我和你一起去。"
            ],
            [
                "I've got everything ready except for the food and drinks.",
                "除了食物和饮料，我都准备好了。"
            ],
            [
                "Bradley: Great!",
                "布拉德利：太好了！"
            ],
            [
                "There's still enough space in my backpack so we can get much food.",
                "我的背包里还有足够的空间，所以我们可以买很多食物。"
            ],
            [
                "Sunday 6 July",
                "7月6日，星期日"
            ],
            [
                "Anna: The trip was fantastic!",
                "安娜：这次旅行太棒了！"
            ],
            [
                "Can you guys send pictures of us in the mountain forest and by the Silver Lake?",
                "你们能把我们在山林里和银湖边的照片发过来吗？"
            ],
            [
                "Also the ones on the grass field!",
                "还有在草地上的那些！"
            ],
            [
                "I want to share those great moments on my social media.",
                "我想在我的社交媒体上分享这些美好的时刻。"
            ],
            [
                "Bradley: Sure!",
                "布拉德利：当然！"
            ],
            [
                "It must be one of my favourite camping trips.",
                "这肯定是我最喜欢的露营旅行之一。"
            ],
            [
                "We're so lucky that the clouds and fog were blown away.",
                "我们太幸运了，云雾都被吹散了。"
            ],
            [
                "Elyse: It's always nice to be in nature, especially with you guys!",
                "伊莉斯：置身大自然总是很美好，尤其是和你们在一起！"
            ],
            [
                "Maybe we should plan an island trip next time!",
                "也许下次我们应该计划一次岛屿之旅！"
            ]
        ]
    },
